BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Night of the Hunter (1955)
DTSTART:20251204T020000Z
DTEND:20251204T035000Z
DTSTAMP:20251204T020000Z
UID:m3c3J36K5J
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Part fairy tale\,
  part Southern gothic horror story\, The Night of the Hunter tells the sto
 ry of a psychopathic preacher who pursues two children who hold the key to
  hidden loot. 70th anniversary screening.  Introduced by SIFF Education 
 Manager Megan Garbayo-López.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events
 /siff-movie-club/the-night-of-the-hunter\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
